Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:47.90,H_fil,,0,0,0,,"Step back. Nakatapak ka sa BUTAS NG DUGO ko." Papakansel na niya ang kasal.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:47.90,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.84,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ngayon, SIYA pa ang unang nagpakansel ng engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:02.90,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Lumayo ka.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:03.88,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Nakatapak ka sa butas ng dugo ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:04.82,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ikaw—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.03,0:00:07.93,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sige.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:09.98,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Dumating ako ngayon para tapusin ang engagement na 'to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.37,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pinili ka ng pamilyang Yun kasi iskolar ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:13.77,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at napilitang tanggapin ang match na 'to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.81,0:00:14.71,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Eh ngayon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.75,0:00:15.81,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ang hirap mo na, bato ang niluluto mong kainin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:16.97,S_fil,,0,0,0,,tapos sarili mong libingan pa ang hukayin mo rito.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.01,0:00:17.91,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kapag nalaman ng iba,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.09,S_fil,,0,0,0,,kahihiyan ng pamilyang Yun, sobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:20.03,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Korek.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:21.01,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Palaka, nangangarap ng karne ng swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:22.33,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Isang walang-pera na katulad mo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:24.41,S_fil,,0,0,0,,hindi karapat-dapat sa mentol na katulad ni Yun Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.41,0:00:26.72,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Tito,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.20,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka pa magagalit sa basurang 'to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.24,0:00:29.24,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Madudumihan lang ang kamay mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.28,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sa ganitong lamig,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:31.80,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ang mansion ko lang sa siyudad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:33.00,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ang makapagbibigay sa'yo ng tunay na init.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.16,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ang cellar ng pamilyang Ho
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.40,S_fil,,0,0,0,,punong-puno ng uling para sa buong taglamig.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:37.40,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Lumipat ka na,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.44,S_fil,,0,0,0,,kahit sumabog ang langit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.04,S_fil,,0,0,0,,hindi mangangalay ang kahit isang daliri mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.62,0:00:42.70,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Iharap mo na ang marriage paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:43.86,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Tapos pwede na kayong umalis lahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.66,0:00:45.78,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ano'ng sabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:46.72,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.90,S_fil,,0,0,0,,iharap mo na ang marriage paper.
